=about: VASH, Visual Assistant for shell (c) 1990-1993,1996,2018-2022 vsv

Vash provides variety of tools intended to speedup user interaction with
command string, designed to be intuitive and simple. 

Please, refer to 'man vash' for details.

Vash dialogues split into contexts, such as main view, command editor,
setup page and other. In every context, similar actions performed with
same keys, with some resonable exclusions.

Context-depended help pages is accesible on-line pressing key .:HE... 
Pressing .:HE... again shows help page about common library keys.
Pressing any other key will return from help page.

Visual representation of dialogues and keyboard assignments may be changed
on Your taste with 'vhset' command, using VHSET and TERM environment.
Please, refer to on-line help pages of 'vhset' and to 'man vhset' for details.

---END
